        "text": "\"Create extract_tables.py in the current working directory.\nTask: extracts table cells and row structure from a document.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc319713001tdigJry3cF5R3P",
