    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Considering External Providers**\n\nI'm currently focused on identifying a suitable external provider for the layout extraction functionality. The goal is to select a concrete solution and integrate its use within the `extract_layout.py` script, making it readily apparent which service is being utilized. I am prioritizing a Python-friendly option for ease of implementation.\n\n\n**Implementing Google Cloud AI**\n\nI'm now fully committed to integrating Google Cloud Document AI. I've started coding `extract_layout.py`, including the necessary client library imports and a function for layout extraction. Placeholders for the project ID, location, and processor ID are in place, awaiting user-specific configuration, as that information will be needed to actually run the code. The plan is to build a basic function to test extraction and then expand it.\n\n\n**Defining the Implementation**\n\nI'm now writing the Python code, specifically `extract_layout.py`, which is moving forward according to plan. I've integrated imports for the Google Cloud Document AI client library and defined the `extract_document_layout` function. The function's structure reflects my earlier plan, including project ID, location, and processor ID arguments, along with the file path. Placeholders are in place for user-specific credentials, ensuring the code is adaptable. I am also planning a simple example of how to invoke the layout extraction function.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789863760055,
          "start": 1789863754492
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc317afc001xvrOUhjpOZuYLm",
